{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your\u00a0little\u00a0faith\u00a0machine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your realm starts\u00a0with\u00a0Lost Souls\u00a0just\u00a0drifting around, so\u00a0you\u00a0turn them into Keepers\u00a0and now they help\u00a0you\u00a0grow. Then you\u00a0can\u00a0give them jobs: Prayers send Faith into\u00a0Totems, Extractors\u00a0pull\u00a0it out as orbs, and Recollectors\u00a0pick the orbs\u00a0up\u00a0before they disappear. After\u00a0a few upgrades it\u00a0starts\u00a0to run on its\u00a0own, and you get\u00a0to\u00a0focus on setting up\u00a0the\u00a0next big step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979140/extras/b9bf6312d3efb6b969b1a52a5e686bf0.poster.avif?t=1774267026\" width=1030 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979140/extras/b9bf6312d3efb6b969b1a52a5e686bf0.webm?t=1774267026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979140/extras/b9bf6312d3efb6b969b1a52a5e686bf0.mp4?t=1774267026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Corruption\u00a0shows\u00a0up and\u00a0it\u00a0does not\u00a0play\u00a0nice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While\u00a0you're\u00a0building, Shadows\u00a0are\u00a0converting\u00a0Lost Souls to their\u00a0side. So you\u00a0respond\u00a0the\u00a0only\u00a0way\u00a0a\u00a0responsible\u00a0tiny\u00a0god can: Warriors\u00a0to fight, Evangelists\u00a0to\u00a0convert\u00a0faster, Sacred Walkers\u00a0to\u00a0make\u00a0safe zones. It's\u00a0a\u00a0constant\u00a0back\u00a0and forth, and\u00a0if\u00a0you ignore it\u00a0for\u00a0too long\u00a0you'll\u00a0feel\u00a0it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979140/extras/a509c371aa9ac2099f0ccacc5a2ba4a1.poster.avif?t=1774267026\" width=1030 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979140/extras/a509c371aa9ac2099f0ccacc5a2ba4a1.webm?t=1774267026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979140/extras/a509c371aa9ac2099f0ccacc5a2ba4a1.mp4?t=1774267026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Karma\u00a0brings\u00a0the demons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push\u00a0the\u00a0Karma bar\u00a0far\u00a0enough and\u00a0demons\u00a0arrive. They come\u00a0with\u00a0Faith shields, they\u00a0cause\u00a0problems\u00a0in\u00a0different\u00a0ways, and the\u00a0Boss\u00a0will\u00a0go\u00a0straight\u00a0for\u00a0your Totems. You\u00a0can\u00a0help\u00a0by\u00a0clicking\u00a0them\u00a0down, and\u00a0your Warriors\u00a0can\u00a0attack\u00a0them too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979140/extras/9f98fee6b302c08aa7306597d2c68f4f.poster.avif?t=1774267026\" width=1030 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979140/extras/9f98fee6b302c08aa7306597d2c68f4f.webm?t=1774267026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979140/extras/9f98fee6b302c08aa7306597d2c68f4f.mp4?t=1774267026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Automate, ascend and repeat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Blessings and Miracles\u00a0let\u00a0you\u00a0automate\u00a0more and more\u00a0until\u00a0the\u00a0realm basically runs itself. And when you\u2019ve\u00a0got\u00a0Ascension Points? Rebirth\u00a0whenever\u00a0you\u00a0feel\u00a0like it, grab\u00a0permanent upgrades, and\u00a0start\u00a0again\u00a0with\u00a0a\u00a0better\u00a0setup. Same\u00a0realm, new\u00a0plan, faster\u00a0progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979140/extras/5b011346add06ae89b50decf52019a5f.poster.avif?t=1774267026\" width=1030 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979140/extras/5b011346add06ae89b50decf52019a5f.webm?t=1774267026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979140/extras/5b011346add06ae89b50decf52019a5f.mp4?t=1774267026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3979140?t=1774267026","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3979140?t=1774267026","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979140/a1f05bb5ccc17b14b30f2c796fe9f97bdc7e0143/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774267026","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979140/a1f05bb5ccc17b14b30f2c796fe9f97bdc7e0143/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774267026","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4411360,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your\u00a0little\u00a0faith\u00a0machine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your realm starts\u00a0with\u00a0Lost Souls\u00a0just\u00a0drifting around, so\u00a0you\u00a0turn them into Keepers\u00a0and now they help\u00a0you\u00a0grow. Then you\u00a0can\u00a0give them jobs: Prayers send Faith into\u00a0Totems, Extractors\u00a0